                "text": "If you\u2019re having trouble with a federal agency, my office is here to help.\n\nMy team can help with:\n\u2714\ufe0f Veterans Affairs\n\u2714\ufe0f Social Security\n\u2714\ufe0f Medicare\n\u2714\ufe0f IRS\n\u2714\ufe0f Immigration Services\n\u2714\ufe0f and more\n\nWe\u2019ve already helped over a thousand Floridians this year alone. Reach out on my website today!",
