                "text": "It was an honor to join the VA Town Hall in Brevard County this week. The event brought together veterans, families, and local VA leaders for a resource fair and a leadership panel focused on VA healthcare and benefits.\n\nI joined Orlando VA Director Timothy Cooke and Dr. Brandan Wormsbacher for the discussion, where we heard directly from veterans about their concerns and ideas. Hearing directly from our veterans ensures we continue improving the care and services they depend on. Thank you to everyone who came out to make your voices heard!",
